      "alt": "stkls1028a board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on the TQMLS1028A Embedded Cortex®-A72 module</h1>\r\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKLS1028A, an evaluation kit based on TQMLS1028A, offers embedded computing engineers an ideal platform for development. Key features include Arm® Cortex®-A72 architecture with LS1028A, QorIQ Trust Architecture, Arm® TrustZone®, and support for IEEE 1588. Additionally, the kit provides robust security functions through the QUICC Engine while maintaining low power consumption. Engineers can leverage high-speed communication capabilities via 3x Gigabit Ethernet, 2x PCIe, and 1x USB 3.0 interface. The kit's suitability for an extended temperature range ensures versatility in various applications.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 19:19:26 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
